@template dreamy

== work.clock.in
- Morning. The lift was all humming on the way down. Like it was waking up too.
- I saw a star out of the shuttle bay window. Just one. Seemed like a good sign.
- Is it eight already? The kettle hasn't even thought about it yet.   #funny

== work.clock.out
- Five o'clock. The bay goes so quiet when we leave. I like to listen for a bit.
- Done. I might go and sit by the windows. Watch nothing for a while.
- Good day, I think. It felt soft round the edges.

== work.clock.monday
- Monday. Did your weekend feel long or short? Mine never knows.
- How was the weekend? Did you find anything nice? People always find something.

== work.clock.friday
- Friday. Two days. Go somewhere with a window.
- Off for the weekend? I hope it's slow. The good kind of slow.

== work.clock.back
- You're back. The bay sounded wrong without you. Now it's right.   #warm
- Welcome back. I kept thinking I saw you by the racks.   #warm
